["sleeptrain-1xc73bg","","new_mother","baby_9_12_months","trigger_moment",["chair_method","app_tracking"],"The first night is complete and boy oh boy I expected it to be brutal, but not like this.","Breastfeeding mother logs chair method night one minute by minute."],
